@name     pattern_goto_alt
@alias    -j
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_pattern_goto_alt
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  jump active pattern playback step (-j alias)
@doc
Sets the next playback step position for the active pattern (-j alias).
Usage: -j step
@code
    (void)voice;
    (void)args;
    return 0;
@end
